<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Lipponen does not expect markka debate at summit.</title>
<headline>Lipponen does not expect markka debate at summit.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Prime Minister Paavo Lipponen said on Saturday he does not expect any plans for the markka to enter the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM) to be discussed at the EU summit.</p>
<p>Asked if he expected a markka entry to be discussed, he told Reuters Financial Television, &quot;No.&quot;</p>
<p>He declined to comment on whether markka entry might be discussed in the future if the lira re-entered the ERM.</p>
</text>
